CalibratedModel
    ShortRateModel : CalibratedModel | qlShortRateModelAsCalibratedModel
	OneFactorAffineModel : ShortRateModel | qlOneFactorAffineModelAsShortRateModel
	    HullWhite : OneFactorAffineModel | qlHullWhiteAsOneFactorAffineModel
